docs {
  ## Wallet Records — Filtered By Type

  Tests filtering wallet records by type (CREDIT or DEBIT).

  ### Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type   | Description            |
  |-----------|--------|------------------------|
  | type      | string | `CREDIT` or `DEBIT`    |

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [...],
      "pagination": { ... }
    }
  }
  ```
